.TH QUIPU-MCP 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-mcp \- Serve the MCP tools over stdio through the sibling quipu\-server
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu mcp\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-mcp\-token\-file\fR] [\fB\-\-bind\fR] [\fB\-\-primary\-url\fR] [\fB\-\-read\-only\fR] [\fB\-\-embed\-backfill\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Serve the MCP tools over stdio through the sibling quipu\-server
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-mcp\-token\-file\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-bind\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-primary\-url\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-read\-only\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-embed\-backfill\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
